      "hash": "4d41c905ab93be1bc3e38ed6356429561c18ba6963f5727065d23e17b9e32aab",
      "heading": "On nature",
      "excerpt": "Both groups reject the primacy of nature, but what that means for them is very different. Symbolism uses extensive natural imagery as a mean",
