      "hash": "2c194460720b2f676737c992fac61c930c5c5504a83e2cd8f8706a8f415e9871",
      "heading": "On reality, illusion, and truth",
      "excerpt": "Both groups are disillusioned with the meaning and truth offered by the natural world, rational thought, and ordinary society. Symbolism tur",
